nd tweezers, so you can confidently place the seeds on the right points. </p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="496f8d30-eff1-416a-ad77-db5c017b84c8" class="r-1r5ek1t" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c44322c2-0b24-4aeb-802a-bbcea2cdf14c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7b32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-fe0upp"><div data-rid="5f5ef9bd-7898-4e05-abc9-e4fe17ab91fc" class="r-rqknob alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>How long should I wear ear seeds for?</h3></span></div><div data-rid="e0deffde-ab2a-4e7f-9619-bc4cea488e2c" class="r-nf6na0" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-tr1ol2" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7b32:"><div data-rid="b64d8608-944e-4476-9448-07b516f6445e" class="r-1h5ohby"><div data-rid="43d4afb7-10a5-4df6-b4bf-3db331e23d35" class="r-1t19zwv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Ear seeds can be worn for 3–5 days at a time. You can press on them throughout the day for extra stimulation. For best results, consistency over a few weeks can make a noticeable difference.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="773aaab5-6882-4e3a-b2c2-07900395d2b1" class="r-1d6pwh0" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c240fdd6-e166-49bc-939d-ccfeb30ef1bb" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9b32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-w5ao8s"><div data-rid="fc1d330a-0935-45fe-9162-b016286eda84" class="r-jf1mj6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>Do ear seeds hurt when applied?</